&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;配置示例&#34;&gt;配置示例&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;配置示例&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae%e7%a4%ba%e4%be%8b&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;此章节的永久链接&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
